--- /dev/null
+++ b/.claude/commands/check-done.md
@@ -0,0 +1,16 @@
+---
+description: "Run the definition of done: protected files, unit tests, and acceptance specs on every channel"
+disable-model-invocation: true
+---
+The human typed /check-done to check whether the work in this worktree is done.
+
+From the repository root, run:
+
+    pwsh -File scripts/check-done.ps1
+
+It runs the acceptance specs on every channel after the unit tests, so allow
+it up to 10 minutes.
+
+Then report the summary: each check with PASS or FAIL, and for each failure,
+what failed and why. Don't change any files or try to fix anything: the
+human decides what happens next.
